message: "If this notebook course helped your work, please cite it."
title: "Kwant - Theory and Practice: an executed notebook course on quantum transport with Kwant 1.5"
type: software
version: "1.3.1"
date-released: "2026-09-01"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fabiocampolim-design/kwant-skill"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
