    given-names: Fabio
keywords:
  - Kwant
  - quantum transport
  - tight-binding
  - topological insulators
  - Majorana
  - Jupyter
abstract: >-
  A self-contained, fully executed Jupyter course on quantum transport with
  Kwant 1.5 in twelve chapter notebooks: theory next to runnable code for the
  core API, ten topological models (SSH, Kitaev, Majorana nanowire, Thouless
  pump, Haldane, Kane-Mele, p+ip, BBH, Weyl, 3D TI), with two solutions
  notebooks for its 25 exercises, an undergraduate course deck, a Windows
  installer and installation-verification scripts.
